WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.411
Your team has AI accounts now.

2
00:00:02.561 --> 00:00:05.641
Most of them are still looking at an empty
chat box.

3
00:00:05.791 --> 00:00:07.916
One demo didn't change how they work.

4
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.712
With us, people learn on their own work.

5
00:00:11.862 --> 00:00:14.593
They bring a real task and walk out with
it finished.

6
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.275
First, we find out which tasks eat up your
team's week.

7
00:00:20.425 --> 00:00:21.963
Those become the lessons.

8
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.579
Then we build a plan for each role,

9
00:00:27.579 --> 00:00:30.818
with exercises made from your own reports
and files.

10
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.249
In the session, everyone works on their
own task,

11
00:00:37.249 --> 00:00:40.887
and learns to check the AI's draft before
anything goes out.

12
00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:47.038
Your company's rules are part of every
exercise,

13
00:00:47.038 --> 00:00:49.772
so people know what's allowed without
guessing.

14
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.366
And we don't disappear after training.

15
00:00:54.516 --> 00:00:58.182
A follow-up session and office hours keep
the new habits in place.

16
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.718
Start with one team.

17
00:01:01.868 --> 00:01:04.168
Book a call at sandboxinnovate.com.

